_:B00a12ac70220b0dd12e3578d2485bfb1 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/093-002>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000115;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000144;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "b is a process_profile =Def. there is some process c such that b process_profile_of c (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [093-002])"@en.
_:B00ca005b3441dd26529c2bcc1cf3192c cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/027-004>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000602;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000024;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(forall (x) (if (FiatObjectPart x) (and (MaterialEntity x) (forall (t) (if (existsAt x t) (exists (y) (and (Object y) (properContinuantPartOfAt x y t)))))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [027-004] ".
_:B023c426d1702ed160042af53325ae0dd cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/062-002>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000600;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000016;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "b is a disposition means: b is a realizable entity & b’s bearer is some material entity & b is such that if it ceases to exist, then its bearer is physically changed, & b’s realization occurs when and because this bearer is in some special physical circumstances, & this realization occurs in virtue of the bearer’s physical make-up. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [062-002])"@en.
_:B027aab694c7b6dc8309c86b4151e9206 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/027-004>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000600;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000024;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "b is a fiat object part = Def. b is a material entity which is such that for all times t, if b exists at t then there is some object c such that b proper continuant_part of  c at t and c is demarcated from the remainder of c by a two-dimensional continuant fiat boundary. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [027-004])"@en.
_:B0390fe7235a74c2ee7b59b73eb8daffd cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/102-001>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000600;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000148;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "A zero-dimensional temporal region is a temporal region that is without extent. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [102-001])"@en.
_:B04988bd4cbe0e1482f0ce7240208e228 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/0000001>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    rdfs:comment "requested by Melanie Courtot";
                                    rdfs:seeAlso <https://groups.google.com/d/msg/bfo-owl-devel/s9Uug5QmAws/ZDRnpiIi_TUJ>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000116;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000147;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "zero dimension continuant fiat boundaries are not spatial points. Considering the example 'the quadripoint where the boundaries of Colorado, Utah, New Mexico, and Arizona meet' : There are many frames in which that point is zooming through many points in space. Whereas, no matter what the frame, the quadripoint is always in the same relation to the boundaries of Colorado, Utah, New Mexico, and Arizona."@en.
_:B056ca7234dcdf4ac0789480fdd192311 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/009-002>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000601;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000002;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "if b is a continuant and if, for some t, cis continuant_part of b at t, then c is a continuant. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [009-002])"@en.
_:B058b34f0228a4825dcf2ea293d26772e cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/017-002>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000602;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000004;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(iff (IndependentContinuant a) (and (Continuant a) (not (exists (b t) (specificallyDependsOnAt a b t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [017-002] ".
_:B07758d1e15a4907e1762a2d6524250b5 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/063-002>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000601;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000016;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "If b is a realizable entity then for all t at which b exists, b s-depends_on some material entity at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [063-002])"@en.
_:B0ba3fe9ad1381c2c25b9210c01c6e61f cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/0000007>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000116;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000002;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "Continuant doesn't have a closure axiom because the subclasses don't necessarily exhaust all possibilites. For example, in an expansion involving bringing in some of Ceuster's other portions of reality, questions are raised as to whether universals are continuants"@en.
_:B0fa8e1129b214f4f0556f8861e32e518 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/029-001>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000602;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000140;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(iff (ContinuantFiatBoundary a) (and (ImmaterialEntity a) (exists (b) (and (or (ZeroDimensionalSpatialRegion b) (OneDimensionalSpatialRegion b) (TwoDimensionalSpatialRegion b)) (forall (t) (locatedInAt a b t)))) (not (exists (c t) (and (SpatialRegion c) (continuantPartOfAt c a t)))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [029-001] ".
_:B1014355f48ca301915e1083dbb58bbf8 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/055-001>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000602;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000019;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(forall (x) (if (Quality x) (SpecificallyDependentContinuant x))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [055-001] ".
_:B111205919a646e2d591b3b46e533e541 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/019-002>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000600;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000040;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "A material entity is an independent continuant that has some portion of matter as proper or improper continuant part. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [019-002])"@en.
_:B11ba3e9c7fc3491369cd2599d68de56f cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/108-001>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000601;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000003;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "Every occurrent occupies_spatiotemporal_region some spatiotemporal region. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [108-001])"@en.
_:B12431fd4483ec4085e32f5730206aa95 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/021-002>;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> cdao:IAO_0000602;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> cdao:BFO_0000040;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "(forall (x) (if (and (Entity x) (exists (y t) (and (MaterialEntity y) (continuantPartOfAt x y t)))) (MaterialEntity x))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [021-002] ".
