                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "b is an object means: b is a material entity which manifests causal unity of one or other of the types CUn listed above & is of a type (a material universal) instances of which are maximal relative to this criterion of causal unity. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [024-001])"@en.
_:B78dee3fe7191c34280a1cf17eb9e2a88 cdao:IAO_0010000 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/001-001>;
