                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An organic heterobicyclic compound that consists of 2-oxohexahydro-1H-thieno[3,4-d]imidazole having a valeric acid substituent attached to the tetrahydrothiophene ring. The parent of the class of biotins.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000412 cdao:chebi.owl;
