cdao:GO_0043234 cdao:IAO_0000111 "protein complex";
                cdao:IAO_0000112 "A ribosome is a protein complex";
                cdao:IAO_0000115 "A stable macromolecular complex composed (only) of two or more polypeptide subunits along with any covalently attached molecules (such as lipid anchors or oligosaccharide) or non-protein prosthetic groups (such as nucleotides or metal ions). Prosthetic group in this context refers to a tightly bound cofactor. The component polypeptide subunits may be identical.";
