cdao:IAO_0000059 cdao:IAO_0000111 "report figure"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000124;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A report figure is a report display element that has some aspect of illustration, but may be a composite of figures, images, and other elements"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "Replaced by defined version of figure"@en,
                                  "I prepended the 'report ' to make it clear that we mean parts of reports here. We may want a more generic version of 'figure', in which case this would become a defined class - figure and part_of some report"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "person:Alan Ruttenberg"@en,
                                  "person:Allyson Lister"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI_0000027",
                                  "group:OBI"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000231 cdao:IAO_0000103;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "obsolete2_report figure"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#ObsoleteClass>;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> true.
cdao:IAO_0000064 cdao:IAO_0000111 "algorithm"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "PMID: 18378114.Genomics. 2008 Mar 28. LINKGEN: A new algorithm to process data in genetic linkage studies."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A plan specification which describes the inputs and output of mathematical functions as well as workflow of execution for achieving an predefined objective. Algorithms are realized usually by means of implementation as computer programs for execution by automata."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PlanAndPlannedProcess Branch"@en,
                                  "Philippe Rocca-Serra"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI_0000270"@en,
                                  "adapted from discussion on OBI list (Matthew Pocock, Christian Cocos, Alan Ruttenberg)"@en;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "algorithm"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:IAO_0000104.
cdao:IAO_0000065 cdao:IAO_0000111 "software interpreter"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "R program, Perl interpreter, Java virtual machine"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A software interpreter is a software application that executes some specified input software. "@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "Do we care? Jennifer: Yes, there was a particular version of R that had a bug and it was fixed later. That would imply that we mean specific version of an interpreter. So an instance of this would be a particular version of the interpreter"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "person:Alan Ruttenberg"@en,
                                  "person:Chris Stoeckert"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "group:OBI"@en,
                                  "OBI_0000199"@en;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "software interpreter"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:IAO_0000064.
cdao:IAO_0000078 cdao:IAO_0000111 "curation status specification"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "The curation status of the term. The allowed values come from an enumerated list of predefined terms. See the specification of these instances for more detailed definitions of each enumerated value."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "Better to represent curation as a process with parts and then relate labels to that process (in IAO meeting)"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Bill Bug"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI_0000266"@en,
                                  "GROUP:OBI:<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/obi>"@en;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "curation status specification"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:IAO_0000102;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#oneOf> (cdao:IAO_0000002
                                                                                                         cdao:IAO_0000120
