cdao:IAO_0000596 cdao:IAO_0000112 """Ontology: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/idrange/>
  Annotations: 
     'has ID prefix': \"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_\"
     'has ID digit count' : 7,
     rdfs:label \"RO id policy\"
     'has ID policy for': \"RO\"""";
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 """Relates an ontology used to record id policy to the number of digits in the URI. The URI is: the 'has ID prefix\" annotation property value concatenated with an integer in the id range (left padded with \"0\"s to make this many digits)""";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Person:Alan Ruttenberg";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>;
                 rdfs:label "has ID digit count"@en.
cdao:IAO_0000597 cdao:IAO_0000112 """Datatype: idrange:1
Annotations: 'has ID range allocated to': \"Chris Mungall\"
EquivalentTo: xsd:integer[> 2151 , <= 2300]
""";
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "Relates a datatype that encodes a range of integers to the name of the person or organization who can use those ids constructed in that range to define new terms";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Person:Alan Ruttenberg";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>;
                 rdfs:label "has ID range allocated to"@en.
cdao:IAO_0000598 cdao:IAO_0000112 """Ontology: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/idrange/>
  Annotations: 
