                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The section labelled 'conflict of interest statement' in a typical scientific journal article."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A part of a document used to declare any competing interests regarding the authors and/or funding organization for the work described in the document."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Bill Baumgartner"@en;
