                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The section labelled 'ethical approval' in a typical scientific journal article."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A part of a document about the governance body responsible for approving the work discussed in a document on an ethical basis."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Bill Baumgartner"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000118 "ethical approval"@en;
