cdao:IAO_0000632 cdao:IAO_0000111 "study limitations textual entity"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 """Excerpt from the Limitations section of Fermann et al 2015, Acad Emerg Med. 2015 Mar; 22(3): 299–307 (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4405051/). 

Owing to the nature of a post hoc study, any significant values must be interpreted with caution. In the current analysis, no multiple testing was conducted and p-values remain unadjusted. Moreover, a selection bias arising from the randomized open-label design of the original EINSTEIN PE study cannot be ruled out."""@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A textual entity addressing a shortcoming or bias of a study design or execution."@en;
