cdao:IAO_0000639 cdao:IAO_0000111 "related work section"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The section labelled 'related work' in a typical scientific journal article, e.g. Žitnik and Zupan. Bioinformatics. 2015 Jun 15; 31(12): i230–i239. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4542780/)"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A part of a document about work in other publications that is relevant to the content of the document."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Bill Baumgartner"@en;
