                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>].
cdao:IAO_0000640 cdao:IAO_0000111 "related work textual entity"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 """Excerpt from Žitnik and Zupan. Bioinformatics. 2015 Jun 15; 31(12): i230–i239. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4542780/):

Our work presented here is similar in spirit to our recently developed methodology for data fusion via collective matrix factorization (Žitnik and Zupan, 2015).

"""@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A textual entity that discusses work from other publications and expresses their relevancy to the content of a document."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Bill Baumgartner"@en;
