                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>].
cdao:IAO_0000642 cdao:IAO_0000111 "requirements textual entity"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 """From Qi et al. BMC Bioinformatics. 2014; 15: 11. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3897912/):

• Operating systems: Platform independent

• Programming language: Matlab, R, Python

• Other requirements: None

• License: GNU GPL v3

• Any restrictions to use by non-academics: None"""@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A textual entity that expresses the requirements necessary to use a resource, e.g. software."@en;
