                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>].
cdao:OBI_0000067 cdao:IAO_0000111 "evaluant role"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "When a specimen of blood is assayed for glucose concentration, the blood has the evaluant role. When measuring the mass of a mouse, the evaluant is the mouse. When measuring the time of DNA replication, the evaluant is the DNA. When measuring the intensity of light on a surface, the evaluant is the light source."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a role that inheres in a material entity that is realized in an assay in which data is generated about the bearer of the evaluant role"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 """examples of features that could be described in an evaluant: quality.... e.g. \"contains 10 pg/ml IL2\", or \"no glucose detected\")"""@en,
                                  "Role call - 17nov-08: JF and MC think an evaluant role is always specified input of a process. Even in the case where we have an assay taking blood as evaluant and outputting blood, the blood is not the specified output at the end of the assay (the concentration of glucose in the blood is)"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "GROUP:  Role Branch";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI";
                 cdao:IAO_0000232 "Feb 10, 2009.  changes after discussion at OBI Consortium Workshop Feb 2-6, 2009.  accepted as core term.";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "evaluant role"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:BFO_0000040 ; 
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> cdao:RO_0000052 ; 
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                 cdao:BFO_0000023,
                                 [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0000070 ; 
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> cdao:BFO_0000054 ; 
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>].
cdao:OBI_0000068 cdao:IAO_0000111 "reporting party role";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The first section has been pre-designated as the 'Reporting Party' section and should be filled with the Reporting Party's personal information.  http://www.mercedsheriff.com/SelfReporting.htm"@en,
                                  "Person who prepares microarray data in MAGE-TAB format and submits to a database, such as ArrayExpress.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a study personnel role played by a party who reports the outcome of a study component"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "MO:submitter mapped to this term. So, alternative term 'submitter' was added.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Jennifer Fostel"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000118 "reporting party",
                                  "submitter";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI"@en;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "reporting party role"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:OBI_0000202.
cdao:OBI_0000070 cdao:IAO_0000111 "assay"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Assay the wavelength of light emitted by excited Neon atoms. Count of geese flying over a house.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A planned process with the objective to produce information about the material entity that is the evaluant, by physically examining it or its proxies."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "12/3/12: BP: the reference to the 'physical examination' is included to point out that a prediction is not an assay, as that does not require physical examiniation. ";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PlanAndPlannedProcess Branch"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000118 "scientific observation"@en,
                                  "measuring"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI branch derived"@en;
                 cdao:OBI_0001847 "study assay";
                 cdao:OBI_9991118 "any method";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "assay"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> (cdao:BFO_0000040
                                                                                                                                  [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0000067 ; 
