                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An eMedical record is a digital document derived from a computer system used primarily for patient care in a clinical setting.  Not required to be compliant with requirements of 21 CFR Part 11."@en;
