cdao:OBI_0000079 cdao:IAO_0000111 "culture medium";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "A growth medium or culture medium is a substance in which microorganisms or cells can grow.  Wikipedia, growth medium, Feb 29, 2008"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a processed material that provides the needed nourishment for microorganisms or cells grown in vitro.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 """changed from a role to a processed material based on on Aug 22, 2011 dev call. Details see the tracker item: http://sourceforge.net/tracker/?func=detail&aid=3325270&group_id=177891&atid=886178
Modification made by JZ.""";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Person: Jennifer Fostel, Jie Zheng"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI"@en;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "culture medium"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:OBI_0000047.
cdao:OBI_0000083 cdao:IAO_0000111 "electronic case report tabulation"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An electronic case report tabulation is a digital document containing tabular data about multiple trial participants which is part of a clinical regulatory submission.  An eCRT has the property that it can be audited and compliant with requirements of 21 CFR Part 11  and has format suited to review by regulators."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "person:Jennifer Fostel"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "CDISC glossary";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "electronic case report tabulation"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:IAO_0000030.
cdao:OBI_0000084 cdao:IAO_0000111 "polystyrene tube"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Polystyrene tubes can be used  to contain tissue culture cells during centrifgation"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a polystyrene tube is a test tube made of polystyrene"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Chris Stoeckert"@en;
