                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "One that detects, especially a mechanical, electrical, or chemical device that automatically identifies and records or registers a stimulus, such as an environmental change in pressure or temperature, an electric signal, or radiation from a radioactive material.   http://www.answers.com/topic/detector  19feb2009";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "detector reagent role"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:BFO_0000023.
