cdao:OBI_0000146 cdao:IAO_0000111 "supernatant collection system harvesting frame"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a device that is designed for collecting 90% of the supernatant in a microplate well and separating the living cell with no stress, eliminating centrifugation and other similar techniques. It can be used in a variety of release assays with different radioactive isotopes, such as Cr51 or I125."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Daniel Schober"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "google"@en;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
