                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Culturing  cytotoxic T-lymphocytes together with target cells in order to study lysis of the target cells. See chromium_release_assay"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A material combination in which cell cultures of two or more different types are are combined and allowed to culture as one."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PlanAndPlannedProcess Branch"@en;
