cdao:OBI_0000186 cdao:IAO_0000111 "protocol optimization objective"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "Protocol_optimization is a protocol_testing_objective role describing a study designed to identify the best protocol.  This may be carried out by comparing different protocols or by modifying the parameters used within a single protocol."@en;
