                                 [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> ([<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0500001 ; 
