                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "http://www.affymetrix.com/products/arrays/specific/hgu133.affx is_manufactered_by http://www.affymetrix.com/ (if we decide to use these URIs for the actual entities)"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 """c is_manufactured_by o means that there was a process p in which c was built in which a person, or set of people or machines did the work(bore the \"Manufacturer Role\", and those people/and or machines were members or of directed by the organization to do this."""@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Alan Ruttenberg"@en,
                                  "Liju Fan"@en;
