                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>].
cdao:OBI_0000391 cdao:IAO_0000111 "energy supply function"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An energy supply function is a function to supply or transfer energy from an energy source to a consumer of the energy"@en;
