cdao:OBI_0000400 cdao:IAO_0000111 "display function"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A display function is a function to present information by translating that information through some lookup process into visual form."@en;
