cdao:OBI_0000411 cdao:IAO_0000111 "cloning vector role";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "pBluescript plays the role of a cloning vector";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A material to be added role played by a small, self-replicating DNA or RNA molecule - usually a plasmid or chromosome - and realized in a process whereby foreign DNA or RNA is inserted into the vector during the process of cloning."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "JZ: related tracker: https://sourceforge.net/p/obi/obi-terms/102/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Helen Parkinson";
