cdao:OBI_0000422 cdao:IAO_0000111 "syringe";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Accuracy of oral liquid measuring devices: comparison of dosing cup and oral dosing syringe.Ann Pharmacother. 2008 Jan;42(1):46-52. Epub 2007 Dec 4. PMID: 18056832"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a processed material which is used to introduce or draw fluids from a material entity. A syringe is made of a piston and body. the movement of the piston in the body determines the amount/volume of fluid to inject or draw"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI Instrument adapted from Wikipedia";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
