cdao:OBI_0000443 cdao:IAO_0000111 "analyte assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "example of usage: In lab test for blood glucose, the test is the assay, the blood bears evaluant_role and glucose bears the analyte role. The evaluant is considered an input to the assay and the information entity that records the measurement of glucose concentration the output";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An assay with the objective to capture information about the presence, concentration, or amount of an analyte in an evaluant.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Bjoern Peters",
                                  "Alan Ruttenberg",
                                  "Philippe Rocca-Serra",
                                  "Helen Parkinson";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "Alan Ruttenberg",
                                  "Helen Parkinson",
                                  "OBI Planned process branch",
                                  "Bjoern Peters",
                                  "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "analyte assay";
                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0000437 ; 
