cdao:OBI_0000457 cdao:IAO_0000111 "manufacturing";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "Manufacturing is a process with the intent to produce a processed material which will have a function for future use. A person or organization (having manufacturer role) is a participant in this process"@en;
