cdao:OBI_0000552 cdao:IAO_0000111 "reverse transcribed polymerase chain reaction";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 """Harmonisation of multi-centre real-time reverse-transcribed PCR results of a candidate prognostic marker in breast cancer: an EU-FP6 supported study of members of the EORTC - PathoBiology Group.

Span PN, Sieuwerts AM, Heuvel JJ, Spyratos F, Duffy MJ, Eppenberger-Castori S, Vacher S, O'Brien K, McKiernan E, Pierce A, Vuaroqueaux V, Foekens JA, Sweep FC, Martens JW.
Eur J Cancer. 2009 Jan;45(1):74-81. PMID: 19008094""";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "reverse transcribe pcr is a process which allow amplification of cDNA during a pcr reaction while the cDNA results from a retrotranscription of messenger RNA isolated from a material entity.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "3/21/10,  BP:Modified definition to clarify that this is not the assay, but the material transformation";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
                 cdao:IAO_0000118 "reverse transcription polymerase chain reaction",
                                  "RT-PCR";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "reverse transcribed polymerase chain reaction";
