cdao:OBI_0000656 cdao:IAO_0000111 "data set of predicted values according to fitted curve";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A data set which is the output of a curve fitting data transformation in which the aim is to find a curve which matches a series of data points and possibly other constraints."@en;
