cdao:OBI_0000661 cdao:IAO_0000111 "enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "1) Detection of IL-2 (analyte) in a cell supernatant (evaluant), using plate bound anti IL-2 antibodies, and a reporter enzyme-linked reporter antibody. 2) Measurement of IgG antibody (analyte) titer in a serum sample (evaluant) using plate bound antigen and a reporter anti-IgG antibody.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An analyte assay where binding of an enzyme linked antibody to a material entity that is immobilized on solid support is detected utilizing a chemiluminescent reaction. Depending on the setup, the enzyme-linked antibody could be binding directly to the analyte, or it serves as a secondary antibody detecting binding of the primary antibody to the analyte.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "IEDB";
                 cdao:IAO_0000118 "ELISA";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "IEDB";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay";
                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> ([<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> (cdao:OBI_0000086
                                                                                                                                                                                  [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:GO_0042571 ; 
