cdao:OBI_0000664 cdao:IAO_0000111 "BrdU incorporation assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The measurement of T cell proliferation as a response to a viral peptide by culturing T cells stimulated with APCs and peptide in the presence of BrdU.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A cell proliferation assay in which cells are cultured in the presence of BrdU which is incorporated into newly synthesized DNA of replicating cells (during the S phase of the cell cycle), substituting for thymidine during DNA replication, which can be quantified by BrdU specific antibodies.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "IEDB";
