                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> cdao:OBI_0000312 ; 
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                 [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> (cdao:BFO_0000040
