cdao:OBI_0000714 cdao:IAO_0000111 "graph of vertices";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "For example, if the nodes are cities, then the edges may have numerical values that correspond to the distances between the cities.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A construct that consists of many nodes connected with edges. The edges represent a relationship between the objects represented by the nodes.  A graph can be equivalently represented as a matrix.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "James Malone",
                                  "Bjoern Peters",
                                  "Chris Stoeckert";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "WEB: http://mitpress.mit.edu/books/FLAOH/cbnhtml/glossary-G.html";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "graph of vertices";
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:IAO_0000038.
cdao:OBI_0000715 cdao:IAO_0000111 "animal care protocol";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Keeping mice in the UCSD animals facility at 20 - 25 degrees celsius, in cages of 4 animals each and providing food twice daily.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An animal care protocol is a protocol which specifies the environment in which animals are being kept in captivity for research purposes";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Bjoern Peters";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "Bjoern Peters";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "animal care protocol";
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:OBI_0000272.
cdao:OBI_0000716 cdao:IAO_0000111 "ChIP-seq assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "PMID: 19275939";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An assay in which chromatin is immunoprecipitated and subsequently analyzed using a DNA sequencing step to identify which parts of DNA are part of the isolated chromatin";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra",
                                  "Bjoern Peters";
                 cdao:IAO_0000118 "chromatin immunoprecipitation sequencing assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "url:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ChIP-sequencing";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "ChIP-seq assay";
