                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                 cdao:OBI_0200171.
cdao:OBI_0000728 cdao:IAO_0000111 "rodent care";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "keeping animal";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "rodent care  is the process by which rodents are being provided with a controlled living environment while kept in captivity for the purpose of research.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PPPB branch";
