cdao:OBI_0000729 cdao:IAO_0000111 "cloning plasmid";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A cloning plasmid is a plasmid that was engineered to contain a bacterial origin of replication, encodes for a selectable gene product and contains a cloning site.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "Note: 'cloning vector role' is really a function. Should be dealt with globally";
