                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A complex of two or more linked MHC molecules including a fluorescent label that can be loaded with a ligand, and is used in flow cytometry assay to bind to T cell receptors of T cells specific for the ligand";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
