cdao:OBI_0000789 cdao:IAO_0000111 "survival rate";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A measurement data that represents the percentage of people or animals in a study or treatment group who are alive for a given period of time after diagnosis or initiation of monitoring.";
