cdao:OBI_0000790 cdao:IAO_0000111 "recombinant BAC cloning";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "Recombinant BAC cloning is a  process with the objective to insert genetic material into an F plasmid based bacterial artificial chromosome for future replication of the inserted material";
