cdao:OBI_0000791 cdao:IAO_0000111 "multiple testing correction objective";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Application of the Bonferroni correction";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A multiple testing correction objectives is a data transformation objective where the aim is to correct for a set of statistical inferences considered simultaneously";
