cdao:OBI_0000810 cdao:IAO_0000111 "informed consent process";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A planned process in which a person or their legal representative is informed about key facts about potential risks and benefits of a process and makes a documented decision as to whether the person in question will participate.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "09/28/2009 Alan Ruttenberg: This is made a subclass of the higher level processual entity in BFO because I don't want to take a stand on whether it is a process aggregate. Analogous to the situation with Material entity.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Person:Alan Ruttenberg";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "http://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/info/glossary#informed";
                 cdao:IAO_0000232 "2009/09/28 Alan Ruttenberg. Fucoidan-use-case";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "informed consent process";
