                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a quality of a DNA molecule that inheres in its bearer due to the order of its DNA nucleotide residues.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "placeholder for SO";
