cdao:OBI_0000841 cdao:IAO_0000111 "subject agrees they understand informed consent document";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A process in which a subject receives an informed consent document and agrees that they have understood it";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "09/28/2009 Alan Ruttenberg. There's a need for a general process like this in IAO - document and person in, signed document (and associated obligations, rights, out";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Person:Alan Ruttenberg";
                 cdao:IAO_0000232 "2009/09/28 Alan Ruttenberg. Fucoidan-use-case";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "subject agrees they understand informed consent document";
                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0000810 ; 
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> cdao:BFO_0000050 ; 
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                 cdao:OBI_0000011.
cdao:OBI_0000842 cdao:IAO_0000111 "informing subject of study arm";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A process in which the subject is made aware of which study arm they are participating in, for example whether they are receiving a placebo or a treatment with an investigational compound.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "09/28/2009 Alan Ruttenberg. This and the class informing-investigator-of-study-arm are defined in order to solve the question of how to represent single and double blind experiments. To represent the aspect of blinding pertaining to subjects (happens in single and double blinding) we say that that the study execution doesn't include any processes of this sort";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Person:Alan Ruttenberg";
                 cdao:IAO_0000232 "2009/09/28 Alan Ruttenberg. Fucoidan-use-case";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "informing subject of study arm";
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:OBI_0000011,
                                 [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> ([<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0000810 ; 
                                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> cdao:BFO_0000050 ; 
                                                                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>]
                                                                                  [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0000097 ; 
                                                                                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> cdao:RO_0000087 ; 
                                                                                                                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>] ; 
                                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> cdao:RO_0000057 ; 
                                                                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>]) ; 
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>].
