                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:OBI_0001978,
                                 [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> ([<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> (cdao:OBI_0000275
