cdao:OBI_0000856 cdao:IAO_0000111 "obsolete intracellular material detection by flow cytometry assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An assay in which the presence of a material inside a cell is measured by permeabilizing the cell membrane to allow entry of specific antibodies, and counting the stained cells using a flow cytometer.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000231 cdao:IAO_0000227;
