cdao:OBI_0000858 cdao:IAO_0000111 "record of unknown sex";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "A database record indicating that the tissue sample in a microarray experiment came from an organism for which the biological sex is not known to the person who created the record.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a record indicating that the biological sex of an organism is not known.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "I think the statement is still about the instance of the biological sex quality of an organism. It is also about information available to the person making the statement.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Bjoern Peters";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
