                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                 cdao:OBI_0000011.
cdao:OBI_0000908 cdao:IAO_0000111 "labeled DNA extract";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a labeled specimen that is the output of a labeling process and has grain labeled DNA to be able to detect DNA in future experiments.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 """Need to find out if we consider labeled nucleotides still nucleotides. It is after consulting with ChEBI group.
Added duirng Mar 1, 2010 dev call""";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Group: OBI group";
