cdao:OBI_0000911 cdao:IAO_0000111 "real time reverse-transcription polymerase chain reaction assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An assay that uses a reverse transcription step (an RNA strand is reverse transcribed into its DNA complement using the enzyme reverse transcriptase) before a PCR assay.";
