                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "The Edinburgh Handedness Inventory is a set of questions used to assess the dominance of a person's right or left hand in everyday activities. "@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Jessica Turner",
