cdao:OBI_0001155 cdao:IAO_0000111 "3D structural organization datum";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The atom coordinates found in a PDB (Protein Data Bank) file, generated by X Ray crystallography or NMR. ";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A measurement datum that describes the structural orientation of a material entity in 3D space. ";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Jason Greenbaum, Randi Vita, Bjoern Peters";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "3D structural organization datum";
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:IAO_0000109.
cdao:OBI_0001156 cdao:IAO_0000111 "age since planting measurement datum"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An age measurement datum that is the result of the measurement of the age of an organism since planting, the process of placing a plant in media (e.g. soil) to allow it to grow, which excludes sowing.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "MO_495 planting";
                 cdao:IAO_0000232 """Discussed by Jie and Chris, proposed to combine with different kinds of processes as initial time point. Proposed 'age measurement assay' is proceeded by some process. The process can be any kind of process defined in OBI. Think it is more flexible. However, it is hard to model  due to lake of temporal predicates on Nov 15, 2010 dev call.
Term proposed by Bjoern on Nov 8, 2010 dev call
Supported by Alan on Nov 15, 2010 dev call""";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "age since planting measurement datum"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:OBI_0001167.
cdao:OBI_0001157 cdao:IAO_0000111 "age since hatching measurement datum"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An age measurement datum that is the result of the measurement of the age of an organism since hatching, the process of emergence from an egg.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "MO_745 hatching";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "age since hatching measurement datum"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:OBI_0001167.
cdao:OBI_0001158 cdao:IAO_0000111 "age determination assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An assay that determines the duration of part of the life of an organism, where the initial time point is the beginning of some transitional state (such as birth or when planted).";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "This assay measures time not developmental stage. we recognize that development takes different time periods under different conditions such as media / temperature. For example, age measurement assay of fly age, the output likes 28 days but not mid-life of age at room temperature.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Alan Ruttenberg";
                 cdao:IAO_0000118 "age measurement assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI group";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "age determination assay";
                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> ([<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> (cdao:OBI_0000067
                                                                                                                                                                                  [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0100026 ; 
