cdao:OBI_0001180 cdao:IAO_0000111 "half maximal effective concentration (EC50)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Determining the potentency of a drug / antibody / toxicant by measuring a graded dose response curve, and determining the concentration of the compound where 50% of its maximal effect is observed. ";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 """half maximal effective concentration (EC50) is a scalar measurement datum corresponding to the concentration of a compound which induces a response halfway between the baseline and maximum after some specified exposure time. 
