                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Detection of the presence of VCAM molecules on the surface of cells in a histology slide using an enzyme-linked antibody followed by enzyme activation to release a dye.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A assay detecting a molecular label assay in which the label is attached to an antibody so that substances are marked based on the antibody's binding specificity.";
