cdao:OBI_0001669 cdao:IAO_0000111 "far-Western blot assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Studying protein-protein interactions via blot overlay or Far Western blot. PMID:15064457";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An assay that measures protein-protein interactions by separating target proteins on an SDS-PAGE gel, transfering them to a solid substrate, hybridizing with a protein probe and visualizing bound proteins using a probe-directed antibody. This is a adaptation on the western blot assay.";
