cdao:OBI_0001933 cdao:IAO_0000111 "value specification";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 """The value of 'positive' in a classification scheme of \"positive or negative\"; the value of '20g' on the quantitative scale of mass.""";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An information content entity that specifies a value within a classification scheme or on a quantitative scale.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "This term is currently a descendant of 'information content entity', which requires that it 'is about' something. A value specification of '20g' for a measurement data item of the mass of a particular mouse 'is about' the mass of that mouse. However there are cases where a value specification is not clearly about any particular. In the future we may change 'value specification' to remove the 'is about' requirement.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Bjoern Peters";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "value specification";
                 rdfs:subClassOf cdao:IAO_0000030.
cdao:OBI_0001934 cdao:IAO_0000111 "predicted value";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "an information content entity that has been generated by a prediction process in which an estimate of a value of an entity is made which can be measured but without performing such a measurement. The value specification is intended to be close to the value a measurement process would produce modulo a prediction error.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Bjoern Peters";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "predicted value";
                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> (cdao:IAO_0000104
                                                                                                                                  [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> cdao:OBI_0001932 ; 
                                                                                                                                                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> cdao:BFO_0000055 ; 
