                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A freezing process by which material entities are quickly frozen by subjecting them to cryogenic temperatures, or in direct contact with Liquid nitrogen at -320.8F or -196°C. ";
