cdao:OBI_0002092 cdao:IAO_0000111 "3' rapid amplification of cDNA ends"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A rapid amplication of cDNA ends to amplify a mRNA sequence between a defined internal site and the 3' end of the mRNA."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "For details see tracker item: https://sourceforge.net/p/obi/obi-terms/790/"@en;
