cdao:OBI_0002160 cdao:IAO_0000111 "multiplexed indexed T7 ChIP-seq assay";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000122;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A ChIP-seq assay which leverages T7 promoter amplification to allow low sample input and chromatin barcoding and pool-and-split multiplexing for high-throughput, quantitative profiling of chromatin states.";
