                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for lung according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is 3 cm or less in greatest dimension, surrounded by lung or visceral pleura without bronchoscopic evidence of invasion more proximal than the lobar bronchus (i.e., not in the main bronchus).";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "https://staging.seer.cancer.gov/tnm/input/1.0/lung/path_t/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a cdao:OBI_0002232,
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                 rdfs:label "pT1 (lung)".
cdao:OBI_0002236 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pT1a (lung)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for lung according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is 2 cm or less in greatest dimension.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "https://staging.seer.cancer.gov/tnm/input/1.0/lung/path_t/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a cdao:OBI_0002232,
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                 rdfs:label "pT1a (lung)".
cdao:OBI_0002237 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pT1b (lung)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for lung according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is more than 2 cm but not more than 3 cm in greatest dimension.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "https://staging.seer.cancer.gov/tnm/input/1.0/lung/path_t/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a cdao:OBI_0002232,
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                 rdfs:label "pT1b (lung)".
cdao:OBI_0002238 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pT2 (lung)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for lung according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is more than 3 cm but not more than 7 cm or the tumor has any of the following features: involves main bronchus, 2 cm or more distal to the carina, invades visceral pleura, associated with atelectasis or obstructive pneumonitis that extends to the hilar region but does not involve the entire lung.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "https://staging.seer.cancer.gov/tnm/input/1.0/lung/path_t/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a cdao:OBI_0002232,
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                 rdfs:label "pT2 (lung)".
cdao:OBI_0002239 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pT2a (lung)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for lung according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is more than 3 cm but not more than 5 cm in greatest dimension.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "https://staging.seer.cancer.gov/tnm/input/1.0/lung/path_t/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a cdao:OBI_0002232,
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                 rdfs:label "pT2a (lung)".
cdao:OBI_0002240 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pT2b (lung)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for lung according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is more than 5 cm but not more than 7 cm in greatest dimension.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "https://staging.seer.cancer.gov/tnm/input/1.0/lung/path_t/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a cdao:OBI_0002232,
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                 rdfs:label "pT2b (lung)".
cdao:OBI_0002241 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pT3 (lung)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for lung according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is more than 7 cm or one that directly invades any of: parietal pleura, chest wall (including superior sulcus tumors), diaphragm, phrenic nerve, mediastinal pleura, parietal pericardiu or the tumor is in the main bronchus less than 2 cm distal to the carina but without  involvement of the carina or there is associated atelectasis or obstructive pneumonitis of the entire lung or there is separate tumor nodule(s) in the same lobe as the primary.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "https://staging.seer.cancer.gov/tnm/input/1.0/lung/path_t/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a cdao:OBI_0002232,
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                 rdfs:label "pT3 (lung)".
cdao:OBI_0002242 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pT4 (lung)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for lung according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor of any size that invades any of the following: mediastinum, heart, great vessels, trachea, recurrent laryngeal nerve, esophagus, vertebral body, carina or there is separate tumor nodule(s) in a different ipsilateral lobe to that of the primary.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "https://staging.seer.cancer.gov/tnm/input/1.0/lung/path_t/";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a cdao:OBI_0002232,
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                 rdfs:label "pT4 (lung)".
cdao:OBI_0002243 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pathologic primary tumor stage for kidney according to AJCC 7th edition";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A categorical value specification that is a pathologic finding about one or more characteristics of renal cancer following the rules of the TNM AJCC v7 classification system as they pertain to staging of the primary tumor. TNM pathologic primary tumor findings are based on clinical findings supplemented by histopathologic examination of one or more tissue specimens acquired during surgery.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000118 "pT: Pathologic spread kidney primary tumor (AJCC 7th Edition)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "NCI BBRB, OBI";
                 cdao:IAO_0000234 "NCI BBRB";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
