cdao:OBI_0002255 cdao:IAO_0000111 "pT4 (kidney)";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for kidney according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor invades beyond Gerota fascia (including contiguous extension into the ipsilateral adrenal gland).";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
