                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for ovary according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is limited to the ovaries (one or both).";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
