                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for ovary according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor is limited to both ovaries; capsule intact, no tumor on ovarian surface and no malignant cells in ascites or peritoneal washings.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
