                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A pathologic primary tumor stage for ovary according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor has extension to other pelvic tissues and no malignant cells in ascites or peritoneal washings.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
