cdao:OBI_0002426 cdao:IAO_0000111 "chemotherapy treatment within the recent past exclusion criterion";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "An exclusion criterion defined by the pathologist is defined as whether the individual received chemotherapy within the last two years. ";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An exclusion criterion that defines whether chemotherapy was received within a certain timeframe, which when met, makes an individual unsuitable for a given task or participation in a given process.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "NCI BBRB, OBIB";
