cdao:OBI_0002427 cdao:IAO_0000111 "radiation treatment within the recent past exclusion criterion";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "An exclusion criterion defined by the pathologist is defined as whether the individual received  radiation therapy within the last two years. ";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "An exclusion criterion that defines whether radiation was received within a certain timeframe, which when met, makes an individual unsuitable for a given task or participation in a given process.";
