cdao:OBI_0002570 cdao:IAO_0000111 "nCounter Mouse miRNA Expression array";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 """Kolbert, Christopher P., et al. \"Multi-platform analysis of microRNA expression measurements in RNA from fresh frozen and FFPE tissues.\" PloS one 8.1 (2013): e52517. PMID:23382819""";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000428;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A mouse array which is manufacutred by NanoString Technologies. Built upon color-coded molecular barcodes technology, the array profiles miRNA with increased specificity and sensitivty than microarrays.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Venkat Malladi, Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng, Alan Ruttenberg.  Mark A. Miller added based on http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002013";
