                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "Sequence data from a sequence library generated from at least two different sources, where each read in the sequence data includes base calls from a multiplex identifier sequence that can be used to trace the source of the read to its source.";
