cdao:OBI_0302731 cdao:IAO_0000111 "buffer role";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "A buffer of carbonic acid (H2CO3) and bicarbonate (HCO3-) is present in blood plasma, to maintain a pH between 7.35 and 7.45. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buffer_solution";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a role which inheres in some molecular entity realized during the process of buffering";
