                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                 cdao:OBI_0600014.
cdao:OBI_0302887 cdao:IAO_0000111 "staining";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "PMID: 18540298. Role of modified bleach method in staining of acid-fast bacilli in lymph node aspirates. Acta Cytol. 2008 May-Jun;52(3):325-8."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "Staining is a process which results in the addition a class-specific (DNA, proteins, lipids, carbohydrates) dye to a substrate to qualify or quantify the presence of a specific compound."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "adapted from Wikipedia: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Staining";
