cdao:OBI_0302888 cdao:IAO_0000111 "washing";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "PMID: 6874122. Dialysis leucopenia--no correction after prolonged washing of the membrane. Int J Artif Organs. 1983 May;6(3):113-4."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "washing is a process by which a material entity acting as  contaminant (e.g. excess staining reagent) is removed by application of one or more cycles of solution in flow."@en;
