                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "irradiation is a process by which a material entity is exposed to radiative energy, which could be ionizing radiation (such as gamma rays or X-rays)  or not such as UV light or microwaves"@en;
