cdao:OBI_0302890 cdao:IAO_0000111 "polymerization";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "PMID: 18517209. The electronic role of DNA-functionalized carbon nanotubes: efficacy for in situ polymerization of conducting polymer nanocomposites. J Am Chem Soc. 2008 Jun 25;130(25):7921-8. Epub 2008 Jun 3."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "polymerization is process by which molecular entity of small mass are aggregated in motifs over the course of a chemical reaction catalyzed by enzymes or other molecular entities acting as catalyst. polymerization results in molecular entity of high molecular weight"@en;
