                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The use of mild trypsinization conditions in the detachment of endothelial cells to promote subsequent endothelialization on synthetic surfaces. Biomaterials. 2007 Sep;28(27):3928-35. PMID: 17570483"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
