cdao:OBI_0302894 cdao:IAO_0000111 "cell lysis";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "PMID: 18484276.Cell lysis with dimethyl sulphoxide produces stable homogeneous solutions in the dichlorofluorescein oxidative stress assay. Free Radic Res. 2008 May;42(5):435-41."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "cell lysis is a process by which cell membrane integrity of live cells  is compromised and leads to cell death. Cell lysis may be achieved by means of viral action or osmotic shock."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "BP, JG, RV: There is also a need for the unplanned cell lysis, which is probably not in the scope of OBI, but should be linked to from this process.";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "adapted from wikipedia [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lysis]";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
