cdao:OBI_0302897 cdao:IAO_0000111 "asphyxiation";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "PMID: 18246869. Loss of cortical function in mice after decapitation, cervical dislocation, potassium chloride injection, and CO2 inhalation. Comp Med. 2007 Dec;57(6):570-"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "asphyxiation is a process by which oxygen supplies are restricted (by mechanical, e.g obstructing airways or chemical means, e.g. increasing CO2 partial pressure) resulting in termination of life in oxygen reliant organisms."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
