cdao:OBI_0302902 cdao:IAO_0000111 "immobilization";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "PMID: 18562258. The immobilization of proteins on biodegradable fibers via biotin-streptavidin bridges.Acta Biomater. 2008 May 23."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "immbolization is a process by which material entity become (possibly covalently but not necessarily) attached to the surface of another material entity used a substratum."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI-Branch";
