cdao:OBI_0600006 cdao:IAO_0000111 "killing"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Terminal sacrifice of animals by cervical dislocation at the end of an investigation."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A protocol application in which an organism is intentionally put to death"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "difficult to place this properly - JG. Death process (e.g. unscheduled death) is out of scope but should be added somewhere. All killings have death process as a part, but not all death processes are part of a killing."@en;
