cdao:OBI_0600021 cdao:IAO_0000111 "cell fixation"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "http://www.tissuearray.org/CellLinesProtocolforTMA112.pdf; the treatment of CD8+ cells with methanol at -20oC; http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/entrez?cmd=Retrieve&db=PubMed&amp;list_uids=16080188&dopt=AbstractPlus"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a protocol application to preserve defined  qualities of cells or tissues (sample) which may otherwise change over time"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000116 "should include capturing what qualities are being preserved"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Bjoern Peters"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI branch derived"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000232 "we could generalize this for other input materials"@en;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:label "cell fixation"@en;
