cdao:OBI_0600024 cdao:IAO_0000111 "maintaining cell culture"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "When harvesting blood from a human, isolating T cells, and then limited dilution cloning of the cells, the maintaining_cell_culture step comprises all steps after the initial dilution and plating of the cells into culture, e.g. placing the culture into an incubator, changing or adding media, and splitting a cell culture"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a protocol application in which cells are kept alive in a defined environment outside of an organism.  part of cell_culturing"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PlanAndPlannedProcess Branch"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI branch derived"@en;
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
