                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The use of taq polymerase to amplify a DNA fragment during a PCR."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "DNA polymerase amplification is an enzymatic amplification which uses DNA polymerase enzyme to make copies of a DNA contained in biomaterial used as input"@en;
