cdao:OBI_0600052 cdao:IAO_0000111 "dialysis"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "the use of a dialysis bag of select pore size to remove salt from collagen isolated from mouse cartilage"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a protocol application that uses diffusion through a semi-permeable membrane to separate an input material into two fractions of different composition"@en;
