cdao:OBI_0600053 cdao:IAO_0000111 "electrophoresis"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "Loading a mixture of proteins into a polyacrylamide gel and the application of an electrical current to the gel to separate the proteins by size and change."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000125;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a protocol application that uses an electrical potential to move material through a defined matrix in order to separate it by its resistance to movement and its charge"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Kevin Clancy"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "OBI branch derived"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000232 "Need to define more terms like gel_separation, matrix,centrifugation, and the connection between the force used to separate materials and the medium or barriers."@en;
