                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A function realized as an immune response, which inheres in a T cell, B cell or antibody which derives from or is produced by a cell with prior antigen experience."@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "IEDB"@en;
                 cdao:IAO_0000119 "IEDB"@en;
