cdao:OBI_1110017 cdao:IAO_0000111 "living with infected household contact";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000120;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "a process in which a a human being lives in the same household as another human being that is known to be infected with an infectious agent";
