                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "A cell specimen comprised of a mixed population of cells obtained by processing whole lymph node into individual cells, typically performed using a sieve. This population includes T cells, B cells, macrophages, and other cell types.";
