cdao:OBI_1110060 cdao:IAO_0000111 "process is result of";
                 cdao:IAO_0000112 "The production of IFN-gamma by effector T cells is a process result of T cell stimulation through the TCR";
                 cdao:IAO_0000114 cdao:IAO_0000123;
                 cdao:IAO_0000115 "is a relationship between a process and a preceding occurrent that directly caused the later one to occur";
                 cdao:IAO_0000117 "PERSON:Bjoern Peters",
                                  "IEDB";
                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
